parrot-tools-alchemy (1.0.7) unstable; urgency=low
  * Fix CXXFLAGS addition for autotools.
  * [CR 0116460] Add support for cmake modules.
  * Fix linux/perf clean rule.
  * Add TARGET_SCAN_FOLLOW_LINKS option.
  * [CR 0116458] Allow to depends on a module only if it is enabled.
  * Add support for police (automatic copy of license files).
  * Add a strong dependency on all build file names of modules.
  * Force using arm-2012 toolchain by default (except for p6/p6i).
  * Add dependencies between all/final/plf if needed.
  * Do NOT force rebuild if a copied files is changed.
  * [CR 0119019] Allow autotools/cmake to depends on internal modules.
  * Add error messages for deprecated stuff.
  * USE_GIT_REV is now enabled by default.
  * [CR 0119020] Add TARGET_PBUILD_HOOK_USE_DESCRIBE option to register tags in pal.
  * Make sure generated dependencies have full path.

