parrot-tools-alchemy (1.0.5) unstable; urgency=low

  * Add documentation in project.
  * Fix dependency between configure step and atom.mk.
  * Do not save the module config if it is not yet saved in full config.
  * Add linux-kernel.mk to build linux.
  * Fix check-dyn-deps.sh
  * [BUGFIX 0110202] Updating version failed with .unpack is not clear.
  * Restore original timestamp after strip.
  * Change shebang off ldd during copy.
  * Get git revision of all modules (see USE_GIT_REV option).
  * Allow to force toolchain for linux (TARGET_LINUX_CROSS).
  * Choose correct LIBC for native-chroot.
  * Add sdk generation feature.
  * Add TARGET_ADD_DEPENDS_SECTION feature.
  * Add TARGET_ADD_BUILDID_SECTION option.
  * [BUGFIX 0111429] Final does not preserve symlink
  * Do not use job control in alchemake when stdout is not a tty.
  * Add option to prevent stripping some files.
  * If valgrind is enabled, do not strip linux loader.

